# Dock (docs/DOCK.md): start the desktop on an HDMI monitor. The desktop
# itself (zeroos-dock, labwc, waybar) stays in the zeroos package: Files,
# Camera, Mesh and Remote open things on the monitor with it, and the
# Settings option "On HDMI: start Dock mode" works without this app.
NAME="Dock"
SUMMARY="Desktop on an HDMI monitor: browser, video, terminal, files"
